1
00:00:02,544 --> 00:00:04,379
[Lee Hyesung]
[I'm home, where are you?]

2
00:00:04,504 --> 00:00:05,214
[I'm at a gym]

3
00:00:05,339 --> 00:00:07,132
[Do you mind having
dinner with me?]

4
00:00:07,257 --> 00:00:08,508
You're
late today, sir

5
00:00:18,602 --> 00:00:19,602
Are you following me?

6
00:00:21,688 --> 00:00:23,065
It's my routine

7
00:00:24,274 --> 00:00:25,634
You haven't even
come here recently

8
00:00:25,984 --> 00:00:27,444
You know a lot about me

9
00:00:29,696 --> 00:00:30,948
Let me ask something

10
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:34,535
When will you let
Hyesung go?

11
00:00:34,910 --> 00:00:36,828
Why should I do that?

12
00:00:36,954 --> 00:00:39,539
I told you the ones
he liked were all trash

13
00:00:41,833 --> 00:00:43,502
Among them
you're the worst

14
00:00:43,919 --> 00:00:46,088
I couldn't even dare
to touch him

15
00:00:47,381 --> 00:00:49,221
Yet you use him, saying
you'll make him famous?

16
00:00:50,676 --> 00:00:51,802
Hey

17
00:00:52,135 --> 00:00:53,387
my feelings
for Hyesung is real

18
00:00:54,846 --> 00:00:56,390
Hey, come on!

19
00:00:56,515 --> 00:00:59,101
I can just get in
like it's a coincidence

20
00:00:59,226 --> 00:01:00,560
No, you shouldn't

21
00:01:02,521 --> 00:01:04,189
If Shin Yoo-il
is really in there

22
00:01:04,314 --> 00:01:07,276
I'll cancel everything
you owed me

23
00:01:07,651 --> 00:01:09,319
Are you kidding me?

24
00:01:12,114 --> 00:01:14,324
Soobin, you know
we've met before

25
00:01:16,034 --> 00:01:18,036
When Hyesung was
trapped in a warehouse

26
00:01:19,246 --> 00:01:20,966
remember that kid who
stayed there with him?

27
00:01:22,499 --> 00:01:23,499
That was me

28
00:01:25,127 --> 00:01:26,753
It was since then

29
00:01:26,878 --> 00:01:28,797
that this city boy
became my idol

30
00:01:28,922 --> 00:01:30,924
What? Is that all?

31
00:01:31,049 --> 00:01:32,384
I expected
something epic

32
00:01:32,668 --> 00:01:35,512
But Hyesung thinks
it was you who was there

33
00:01:36,013 --> 00:01:38,682
Have you been
lying to him

34
00:01:38,807 --> 00:01:40,684
only to stay next to him?

35
00:01:40,892 --> 00:01:42,519
That's disgusting
isn't it?

36
00:01:42,811 --> 00:01:44,438
You've pretended
to be his good friend

37
00:01:44,563 --> 00:01:46,815
deceiving him
for over ten years
